    "a.md": "# Synthetic maintenance\n## Isolated bench\n\nOnly in the synthetic laboratory:\n\n- Only the disconnected copper simulator:\n  - Remember the cobalt calibration point.\n    - Example: the amber sandbox.\n    - Counterexample: connected machinery is forbidden.\n  - File the jade ledger by date.\n    - Example: the separate mock archive.\n    - Caveat: do not record a real identity.\n  - Limitation: no production equipment.\n- Condition: use a disposable mock fixture.",
